<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Yavapai County USD 22, Ariz.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Yavapai County USD 22, Ariz.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Peacock, Hislop, Staley, &amp; Given, Inc said it priced $5.365 million of Yavapai County Unified School District No. 22, Ariz., general obligation bonds, Series C (1997) with a top yield of 5.50 percent in 2014.</p>
